                                                  \begin{document}$${{Baseline}}_{k}(f)=\frac{1}{m}\mathop{\sum }\limits_{t=1}^{m}({{ERSP}}_{k}\left. (f,t\right))$$\end{document}Baselinek(f)=1m∑t=1m(ERSPkf,t)where n is the number of trials, and \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
