                                                  \setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
                                                  \begin{document}$${{ERSP}}_{k}\left. (f,t\right)$$\end{document}ERSPkf,t is the ERSP value of kth trial at frequency f and time t, and \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
