                                                  \usepackage{mathrsfs}
                                                  \usepackage{upgreek}
                                                  \setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
                                                  \begin{document}$${{Baseline}}_{k}\left(f\right)$$\end{document}Baselinekf is the average ERSP value within the baseline period, m is the number of time points within the baseline period.
